     "object": "defl_tana_seifa_legaluyei_reisha",
     "gloss_en": "אי משום הא לא איריא: תנא סיפא לגלויי רישא -- the seifa was taught to reveal that the reisha is both salted, and even so permitted",
     "deflects": "s_hachi_nami_mistabra",
     "refuted": false
    }
   ]
